Atum is a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]]. He makes living beings and calls them his children. [[People/Benny|Benny]] is one of them, an android who has looked nine years old since the day he was made, and who calls Atum his father. Atum's other children take whatever shape they please, and some of them have gone rogue.

He reaches Benny in his sleep across a black void, showing himself as a shifting shape of light circled by three turning rings, and the two also trade faxes. He passes on what Belvedere learns, and set Benny to find a twelve-sided green stone, ringing with the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]], that was stolen from a Belvedere archive.
